        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GORE</strong> is a <strong>found footage horror experience</strong> that immerses players in a mountain range designed to resemble the scenery of the Rocky Mountains. Drawing inspiration from the likes of <i>Lovecraft</i>, <i>2001: A Space Odyssey,</i> and <i>John Carpenter’s The Thing</i>, this game pulls you deep into a decaying wilderness where something incomprehensible is rapidly spreading through the surrounding environment. You must discover where this fleshy entity came from, armed with only a flashlight and handheld camera. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/776ec5857ce2ced8bebf0e6563abfe50.poster.avif?t=1776485100\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/776ec5857ce2ced8bebf0e6563abfe50.webm?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/776ec5857ce2ced8bebf0e6563abfe50.mp4?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an environmental and psychological horror that will have the player on the edge of their seats. You can expect  lots of twists and turns and maybe a couple of jump scares! You will also find a lore-rich and linear story with reliance on high tension and fear of the unknown. The game's story is told through the players' inner dialogue and through notes scattered around each level. <strong>Triggering dialogue events and notes via exploration will unlock new areas, allowing the player to progress through the game.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/7f594e214ca5277e4bddfec03bb02151.poster.avif?t=1776485100\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/7f594e214ca5277e4bddfec03bb02151.webm?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/7f594e214ca5277e4bddfec03bb02151.mp4?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>This game includes:</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Handheld/ VHS-like post-processing and realistic movements, creating a nostalgic, yet uncanny experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Two fully <strong>fleshed out</strong> (pun intended) levels which includes mountains, caves, labs, and...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; An original soundtrack composed by myself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; A LOT of fleshy entities, huge eyeballs, and mutated remains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Completely custom mountain Ranges and landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Toggleable flashlight for dark areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; One insane twist that you don't want to miss out on!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.poster.avif?t=1776485100\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.webm?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.mp4?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GORE</strong> is a <strong>found footage horror experience</strong> that immerses players in a mountain range designed to resemble the scenery of the Rocky Mountains. Drawing inspiration from the likes of <i>Lovecraft</i>, <i>2001: A Space Odyssey,</i> and <i>John Carpenter’s The Thing</i>, this game pulls you deep into a decaying wilderness where something incomprehensible is rapidly spreading through the surrounding environment. You must discover where this fleshy entity came from, armed with only a flashlight and handheld camera. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/776ec5857ce2ced8bebf0e6563abfe50.poster.avif?t=1776485100\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/776ec5857ce2ced8bebf0e6563abfe50.webm?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/776ec5857ce2ced8bebf0e6563abfe50.mp4?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is an environmental and psychological horror that will have the player on the edge of their seats. You can expect  lots of twists and turns and maybe a couple of jump scares! You will also find a lore-rich and linear story with reliance on high tension and fear of the unknown. The game's story is told through the players' inner dialogue and through notes scattered around each level. <strong>Triggering dialogue events and notes via exploration will unlock new areas, allowing the player to progress through the game.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/7f594e214ca5277e4bddfec03bb02151.poster.avif?t=1776485100\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/7f594e214ca5277e4bddfec03bb02151.webm?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/7f594e214ca5277e4bddfec03bb02151.mp4?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>This game includes:</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Handheld/ VHS-like post-processing and realistic movements, creating a nostalgic, yet uncanny experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Two fully <strong>fleshed out</strong> (pun intended) levels which includes mountains, caves, labs, and...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; An original soundtrack composed by myself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; A LOT of fleshy entities, huge eyeballs, and mutated remains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Completely custom mountain Ranges and landscapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; Toggleable flashlight for dark areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt; One insane twist that you don't want to miss out on!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.poster.avif?t=1776485100\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.webm?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943880/extras/ef7df4cf4934bcf2ed98e84f045140d1.mp4?t=1776485100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "GORE is a Lovecraft-inspired horror experience set deep in the Rocky Mountains. Explore the wilderness and uncover the origins of the fleshy entity.",
